            <div xml:id="d237-a8">

                <pb facs="0341" n="235" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg235"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure G.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The intendente of
                            Valparaiso to Capt. Schley</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Republic of Chile</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Intendencia of
                                Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-11"><hi rendition="#italic">November 11,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I take pleasure in communicating to you that this intendencia has transmitted to
                    his honor the judge of the criminal court your official note of this date
                    relative to the appearance of the sailors of the ship under your command,
                    involved in the occurrences of the 16th of last month.</p>
                <p>God guard you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. de D. Arlegui</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
